    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "Save",
      "description" : "Creates or updates an MCP in the system. This operation allows configuring MCP details such as endpoint, authentication, and associated tools. If an ID is provided, the existing MCP is updated; otherwise, a new MCP is created.\n\nInput Parameters:\nid (string): Unique identifier of the MCP (used for updating an existing MCP).\nmcpEndpoint (string): Endpoint URL of the MCP.\nmcpName (string): Name of the MCP.\nauthType (string): Type of authentication used (e.g., API key, OAuth).\nauthInfo (object/string): Authentication details required for the MCP.\ndescription (string): Description of the MCP.\nsaveWithoutTools (boolean): Indicates whether to save MCP without fetching or attaching tools.\nallowedTools (array): List of tools allowed or associated with the MCP.\nOutput Parameters:\nmcpId (string): Unique identifier of the created or updated MCP.\nstatus (string): Status of the operation (e.g., success or failure).\nerror (string): Error message in case the operation fails."
    },
    "lockedByUser" : "anoop.gupta2812@gmail.com"
  },
